# Vercel
.vercel
# Narrower than the `.env*` the Vercel CLI writes: this repo intentionally
# tracks .env (public VITE_ keys only, no secrets), and the build depends on it.
# Only the local overrides — including the VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN the CLI drops into
# .env.local — stay out of git.
.env.local
.env*.local
